<title>FRANCE: Global One venture to make profit in 1999 - paper.</title>
<headline>Global One venture to make profit in 1999 - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global One, a telecoms venture of France Telecom,  Deutsche Telekom and Sprint of the United States, will be profitable  in 1999, Global One chairman Viesturns Vucins said in a French newspaper  interview published on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Global One, which generated more than $800 million for 1996, which  consisted of just 11 months, will be profitable in 1999,&quot; he told  Le Figaro.</p>
<p>He said Global One aimed to be &quot;the leading operator for the 2,000  big international companies which represent 50 percent of global traffic  growth&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
